  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/circle-payments-network-reaches-41-3-billion-annualized-volume-in-q3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Circle Payments Network Reaches $41.3 Billion Annualized Volume in Q3</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-04-bitgo-launches-institutional-trading-and-financial-solutions-business-led-by-former-nydig-executive-432646\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BitGo launches institutional trading and financial solutions business led by former NYDIG executive</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-11-04-morgan-stanley-among-first-banks-to-tokenize-us-equities-treasurys-through-dtccs-service-432633\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Morgan Stanley among first banks to tokenize US equities, Treasurys through DTCC\u2019s service</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note